---LINES
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "|space|"






---SCREEN                                     
=vash context views and switching keys

from main view:
 * lowercase letter key -                    ,---> ."main view".............   
    - type unix command from scratch (1)     |             ^|    |         |   
 * digit key or uppercase letter key:        |             || .'[a-z./]    |   
    - put a command template to editor (2)   | ."history". ||    |         |   
    - run programmed command (3)             |     |       ||    |   .'[0-9A-Z]
 .:CA... - switch between main view and      |     ^     .:CA... |        | |  
   command editor, keeping editing content   |   .:HE...   ||   (1)       | |  
                                             |     |       ||    |        | |  
from command editor:                         |,> ."command editor".... <-(2)|  
 * .:HE... - get history view                ||    |                        |  
 * .:NL... - run a command                   || .:NL... ->| run cmd  |<---(3)  
                                             ||              |                 
from exit code indicator:                    ||    ."exit code indicator "..   
 * .:NL... - do nothing, preventing mistakes ||         |    |   |     |
 * .:SP... - return to main view             |`-< .'any_key  |   `-< .:NL...   
                                             `-----------< .:SP...               

 for more details use man vash, please

